1870 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Oh\054 for the days when every second or third trap had a catch\056 Back then\054 success was measured in numbers\024over 13\054000 pests\054 not counting those taken by poison\056 It felt like a job well done\024and it was\056 But things are changing\056 Pest numbers are down\054 and now success is measured by what we\031re not catching\056 The remaining pests are trap\055shy and harder to control\054 but stopping them is critical to)
     /K [ 66 ]
     /P 1871 0 R
     /Pg 1738 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

