1874 0 obj
  << /ActualText (prevent breeding\056 That means keeping at it\054 even when results seem less visible\056 Keep baiting\054 checking traps\054 and trying different approaches\024some possums prefer fish\054 while some rats go for cooked bacon\056 Pre\055baiting can also help\056 As we expand traps and bait stations across larger areas\054 volunteers play a key role\054 but regular checking relies on paid trappers\056 Please consider supporting this work\024just \04425 a month \050about five coffees\051 helps maintain 20 traps\054 and you can claim back a third in donations\056 It\031s rat season for the next four months\054 so now\031s the time to step up trapping and baiting\056 \055 Mike Neil)
     /K [ 68 ]
     /P 1875 0 R
     /Pg 1738 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

