1882 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Thank you to all the volunteers who took part in the Jamiesons Bay Esplanade planting\054 where 110 plants were put in the ground\054 and the Huawai Bay tree project\054 where roadside areas were cleared ahead of tree felling\056 Together\054 these efforts highlight the strength of our community and contribute directly to improving habitat quality and supporting long\055term restoration\056 We\031re looking for a volunteer Planting Coordinator to help organise planting days and support our restoration work\056 Please contact mahurangiwestpest\100gmail\056com)
